{%- comment -%}
  TIKVES LONDON . GRID ADD TO CART
  Rendered under every product card on collection pages, search results
  and related products, so a customer can buy without opening the page.
  Operator ruling 4 Sep 2026: an Add to cart button on all products
  everywhere.

  28 Sep 2026, operator: the full-width bar was too big on the phone, the
  small pill that replaced it was too small. It is now a wide pill,
  centred under the price, most of the card's width but not edge to edge.
  The card's title, descriptor and price are centred to match; that rule
  lives in snippets/tikves-head-css.liquid. Colours unchanged.

  One variant and in stock: adds straight to the cart without a page
  reload and opens the cart drawer.
  More than one variant: sends the customer to the product page.
  Out of stock: the button stays, greyed, reading Sold out.

  The CSS and the click handler live in snippets/tikves-gatc-handler.liquid,
  injected once per page, guarded by window.tkGridAtc. The same handler drives the Add to cart buttons in
  the tikves-singles rows, which use the same data-tk-gatc hook.

  TO UNDO: delete this snippet and the one render line in
  snippets/product-grid-item.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: product.variants.first
  assign many = false
  if product.variants.size > 1
    assign many = true
  endif
-%}

<div class="tk-gatc">
  {%- if product.available == false -%}
    <button type="button" class="tk-gatc__btn" disabled aria-disabled="true">{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}</button>
  {%- elsif many -%}
    <a class="tk-gatc__btn" href="{{ product.url | within: collection }}">{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</a>
  {%- else -%}
    <form class="tk-gatc__form" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" data-tk-gatc>
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
      <button type="submit" class="tk-gatc__btn">{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</button>
    </form>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{%- render 'tikves-gatc-handler' -%}
